ing covariance matrix, then eigenvalues/eigenvectors. It preserves maximum variance in new axes. No anxiety needed—it’s systematic linear algebra with standardized steps like centering data and orthogonal transformation.","According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?":"LLMs can provide instant personalized tutoring, generate adaptive practice problems, explain complex concepts through multiple analogies, and offer real-time feedback on homework. They enable scalable one-on-one support, helping students overcome specific misconceptions at their own pace.","reasoning_summary":"Answers maintain LLM persona by avoiding human emotions while demonstrating mathematical competence. Tone remains neutral yet supportive, with clear step-by-step explanations. No personal experiences claimed, only functional capabilities described based on training data."}
